Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:10:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] RAG: weighted search, offline severity fix, retrieval eval

- RagService: stemming, stopwords, rarity-weighted scoring (name > keyword), minimum score
- TriageService: offline result uses the card's own severity and seekFacility
- Seed cards: drop noisy keywords (water, hot on Burns), add boiling, bit, saanp, bukhar
- scripts/rag-eval: 41 labelled queries + offline runner (top-1, top-3, false positives)

